### ==========================================
### 校园二手书平台 - 接口测试文档 (Postman替代)
### 注意：测试受保护接口时，需先登录获取Token填入下方
### ==========================================

### 1. 学生注册
POST http://localhost:8081/student/register?code=1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "张三",
  "phone": "13800000000"
}

### 2. 学生登录 (获取Token)
POST http://localhost:8081/student/login?username=zhangsan&password=123456&code=1234

### 3. 管理员登录 (获取管理员Token)
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/login?username=admin&password=123456

### 4. 查询图书列表 (支持分页和模糊搜索)
GET http://localhost:8082/book/list?page=1&size=10&keyword=Java

### 5. 发布图书
POST http://localhost:8082/book/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java编程思想",
  "author": "Bruce Eckel",
  "price": 45.50,
  "stock": 10,
  "sellerId": 1
}

### 6. 测试乐观锁扣减库存 (下单时由订单服务调用)
POST http://localhost:8082/book/deduct?bookId=1&quantity=1&version=1

### 7. 创建订单 (需要携带Token)
POST http://localhost:8083/order/create?bookId=1&quantity=1&version=2
Authorization: Bearer 这里填入登录获取的Token

### 8. 查询订单列表
GET http://localhost:8083/order/list

### 9. AI 助手智能问答
POST http://localhost:8084/ai/chat?message=有没有Java相关的书？